      "content": "sharing my experience? teaching people who don't even care? it feels so patronizing. like telling a retired worker to just go volunteer at a soup kitchen so they don't feel so useless. the truth is, the math just doesn't work anymore. i have no utility. i'm just an inefficiency in a system that's optimized for speed and zero human error. isnt it just more logical to phase out things that don't serve a function?",
